## Why This Is Asked
Tests understanding of page fault flow, race conditions, and practical synchronization in a simplified setting.

## Key Concepts
- Per-page state and atomic flags
- Compare-and-swap to guarantee single fault
- Read-ahead and lazy loading in user space
- Testing concurrent fault scenarios

## Code Example
